.DS_Store

# Phase 2: local content-addressed evidence store output (never committed —
# see docs/evidence-storage.md). Only the default root is named here; a
# custom --store directory outside the repository is the caller's own
# responsibility to keep out of git, same as any other --store <dir> value.
.incidentdna/

# Checked-in fictional evidence used by examples/evidence-storage-demo/ —
# exempted from the generic *.log ignore above so it can actually be
# committed; this is synthetic example content, not a generated log file.
!examples/evidence-storage-demo/evidence/*.log
